Kind:       robustness, NOT required to build; not verified on hardware
Status:     REFERENCE ONLY - the firmware build applies the same change as a source
            overlay (source_overlays.cmake, overlay 2); the submodule stays unmodified.
Check:      git -C third_party/cspot apply --check <this file>

After a connection loss the "mercury_dispatcher" task itself runs
MercurySession::reconnect(): an HTTPS request to apresolve.spotify.com (TLS
handshake) plus the Spotify key exchange. 4 kB of stack is very little for an
mbedTLS 3.x handshake; the stack lives in PSRAM, so 16 kB costs no internal RAM.

